# Recipients that should never be greylisted (e.g. role addresses expecting
# time-sensitive mail). One entry per line; see postgrey-whitelist-recipients(5).
#
# This is the .local companion of /etc/postgrey/whitelist_recipients (from
# the postgrey Debian package, which already exempts postmaster@ and abuse@).
# Postgrey reads both; put your own additions here so package upgrades never
# touch them.
